WEBVTT

NOTE
Battle of the Gardens — Rinoa descends on a cable amid the fighting.
Duration: approximately 1 minute 19 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.900
The camera sweeps through Balamb Garden's interior ring.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.040
It moves out across the Garden's exterior.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:58.090
Rinoa grips a cable and slides down from the Garden's underside, over the cliffs.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.480
Below, soldiers exchange fire across the open ground.
